Package: snpscaper
Type: Package
Title: Explore Human Genetic Variation with 1000 Genomes Project Data
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jarek", "Bryk", email = "j.bryk@hud.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2791-9709"))
  )
Description: A teaching package for exploring variation in human populations
    entirely within R. It fetches genotypes for any genomic region directly
    from the 1000 Genomes Project (GRCh38, high-coverage phased panel),
    prepares them for analysis, and supports principal component analysis,
    admixture analysis, allele frequencies, Fst, heterozygosity and linkage
    disequilibrium, with ready-made plots and an HTML handout report.
